WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.784 --> 00:00:15.404
Le train pour Nice part de quelle voie ?
Which platform does the train to Nice leave from?

2
00:00:15.504 --> 00:00:19.196
Voie six, à neuf heures dix.
Platform six, at 9:10.

3
00:00:19.296 --> 00:00:22.892
Un aller simple ou un aller-retour ?
A one-way or a return?

4
00:00:22.992 --> 00:00:26.948
Un aller-retour, en deuxième classe.
A return, in second class.

5
00:00:27.048 --> 00:00:29.900
À quelle heure est l'arrivée ?
What time is the arrival?

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.116
À dix-sept heures. Mais attention, le train est en retard !
At five p.m. But watch out, the train is late!
